msgstr "Analytics Snippet"

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:14 src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:14
msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Analytics"

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:27
msgid "Code to append to public pages"
msgstr "Cote à ajouter aux pages publiques"

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:28 src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:28
#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:44
msgid "Don’t forget to add the tags <script> and </script> for javascript."
msgstr ""
"Ne pas oublier d’ajouter les balises <script> et </script> pour le "
"javascript."

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:45 src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:61
msgid "Before \"</head>\" (recommended)"
msgstr "Avant \"</head>\" (recommandé)"

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:46 src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:62
msgid "Before \"</body>\""
msgstr "Avant \"</body>\""

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:27
msgid "Code to append to all public pages (overridable in site settings)"
msgstr ""
"Code à ajouter aux pages publiques (modifiable dans les paramètres du site)"

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:43
msgid "Code to append to admin pages"
msgstr "Code à ajouter aux pages admin"

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:75
msgid "Privacy of the ip sent to the trackers (server side tracking)"
msgstr "Confidentialité de l’ip envoyée aux traceurs (suivi côté serveur)"

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:76
msgid ""
"Apply to the trackers that send the visits from the server, like Matomo with "
"a token or Google. The masked parts are set to zero. The tracker may "
"anonymize the ips too."
msgstr ""
"S’applique aux traceurs qui envoient les visites depuis le serveur, comme "
"Matomo avec un jeton ou Google. Les parties masquées sont mises à zéro. Le "
"traceur peut aussi anonymiser les ip."

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:78
msgid "Clear ip"
msgstr "Ip en clair"

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:79
msgid "Partial ip (first 3 parts)"
msgstr "Ip partielle (3 premières parties)"

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:80
msgid "Partial ip (first 2 parts)"
msgstr "Ip partielle (2 premières parties)"

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:81
msgid "Partial ip (first part)"
msgstr "Ip partielle (première partie)"

#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:82
msgid "Anonymous (no ip)"
msgstr "Anonyme (sans ip)"

#~ msgid "Trusted reverse proxies for the trackers"
#~ msgstr "Proxys inverses de confiance pour les traceurs"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Ips or cidr ranges (space or comma separated) of the reverse proxies in "
#~ "front of the server (Traefik, Nginx, Varnish…). The headers X-Forwarded-"
#~ "For and X-Real-IP are read only when the direct peer matches this list, "
#~ "so the trackers receive the ip of the visitor and not the one of the "
#~ "proxy. Empty means no proxy."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ip ou plages cidr (séparées par des espaces ou des virgules) des proxys "
#~ "inverses placés devant le serveur (Traefik, Nginx, Varnish…). Les en-"
#~ "têtes X-Forwarded-For et X-Real-IP ne sont lus que si le pair direct "
#~ "figure dans cette liste : les traceurs reçoivent alors l’ip du visiteur "
#~ "et non celle du proxy. Vide : aucun proxy."
